      "proposition": "The VJRA established a comprehensive administrative and judicial review scheme under 38 U.S.C. \u00a7 511 and \u00a7 7292 that implicitly channels facial constitutional challenges to veterans benefits statutes through the CAVC to the Federal Circuit, precluding district court jurisdiction under the Thunder Basin and Elgin frameworks."
